    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαψ-αῦραι</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>,
